{
 "type": "root",
 "children": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Single sign-on lets people sign in with an account on your company's Gitea instead of a password\nkept by ownsolid. The "
    },
    {
     "type": "link",
     "url": "/sso",
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "value": "Single sign-on"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": " page manages the connectors."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Adding a connector"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "adding-a-connector"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": true,
   "start": 1,
   "spread": false,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Register an OAuth application on your Gitea with the callback URLs the dialog shows."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Choose "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Add connector"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": " and enter the provider address, client ID and secret. A new connector\nstarts turned off."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Open the connector and run "
        },
        {
         "type": "strong",
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "value": "Test connection"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": ". It names what Gitea refused, such as the client\nID, the secret or a callback URL that is not registered, or says that Gitea cannot be reached or\ntrusted."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "spread": false,
     "children": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "value": "Turn the connector on, with a reason."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Single sign-on must also be on for the installation and the provider must be approved there; the\npage says when it is not."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "depth": 2,
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Turning a connector off"
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "id": "turning-a-connector-off"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "children": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "value": "Turning a connector off asks you to type its name. It ends the sessions that started through it,\nand they do not come back, so there is no undo."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
